5. P&A, Exception arg Hygiene:
    Phase 1:
    [x] 'ports.py'
        - 'getFileContent' was pruned, not used
    Phase 2:
    [x] 'app/exceptions.py': Prohibit arguments across all BaseEx exception classes
        - Override BaseEx.__init__ to convert any incoming args/kwargs into an IllegalExArgs exception with a synthetic ValueError cause
        - Enforce parameterless exception instantiation at runtime across the entire system
    [x] Move the prohibition of arguments up to BaseEx and integrate ExceptionPolicy
        - Consolidated ExceptionPolicy in app/exceptions.py alongside the exception hierarchy
        - Standardized ExceptionPolicy to treat all system exceptions as parameterless
        - utilizing __cause__ chaining for stack trace formatting and error diagnostics

    [ ] 'ports_adapters/': align exception raising to exception policy. align adapter imports to 'adapter import policy', described below
        - Align all raising of ex to policy, parameterless raising - always omitting parentheses
            - yes: raise ExName
            - no: raise ExName()
            - cause of exit 1 due to policy: raise ExName("we raise the ex!")
        - adapter import policy: Adapters may only import from 'ports' package, or the imports which they encapsulate for the system
        - no members of 'ports' should be 'core near' in their semantics
            - business rules belong in core. the ex of adapters are adapter centric translation only
                - 'NoSuchFile' OK
                - 'IllegalDuplicateFile' - not OK
        [ ] subtasks go here, leave the above untouched

    Phase 3:
    [ ] Portfolio-wide analysis: Review exception responsibilities across adapters
        - any ex raise by an adapter should be declared adjacent to port. the adapter should only import from the port and the ex language of it
        - the semantics of the ex should be adapter centric, referring to the action of the adapter
            - they may be fatal, if the case warrants that
        - move IOControl adjacent to adapter
        - make the members it returns to the service ex raises
        - but retain key vocabulary
    [ ] Core alignment: Update core callers to handle adapter exceptions
        - audit all call sites invoking DiskPort methods
        - ensure core properly catches, translates, or handles Notice and Fatal exceptions from adapters

